  <notes-entry|zettels/local-martingales.tm|When a local martingale is a
  martingale?|Last week we had a discussion in class about
  <with|font-shape|italic|continuous local martingales>. My experience is
  that it is a confusing aspect in learning stochastic calculus. I record
  here some aspects of that discussion. May 15th 2023.|16 May 2023>

